<title>USA: Alltrista completes share repurchase.</title>
<headline>Alltrista completes share repurchase.</headline>
<dateline>MUNCIE, Ind. 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alltrista Corp said on Monday that it completed its repurchase of 400,000 shares of its common stock as authorized by its board of directors in January.</p>
<p>In addition to the 400,000 shares, Alltrista said it bought 30,000 shares in a program that enabled oddlot shareholders to sell their stock directly to the company.</p>
<p>The stock will be used for employee stock plans and general corporate purposes. Alltrista manufactures consumer, plastic and zinc products.</p>
<p>--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
